    "summary": "Large, gold-coloured plaque with Buddha image. Amuletic plate of metal stamped with a seated image of Maitreya Buddha on a lotus throne. His right hand is extended over his leg, and his left hand makes a gesture with the pointer and little fingers extended. At the top of the plaque are letters in Khom script, and at the bottom, an epithet of Maitreya in Thai and the name and location of the monastery, Wat Lai, also in Thai.",
